  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the toaster oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Place the English muffin halves on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "In a small saucepan, melt the butter over low heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Place a spoonful of the garlic butter on each English muffin half.",
    "Top each muffin half with diced chicken breast, shredded mozzarella cheese, and a sprinkle of cilantro leaves.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Bake in the preheated toaster oven for 8-10 minutes, until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
  ],
